### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@email = user@example.com
@password = SecurePassword123!

### Register (Dev B's part, assuming it exists for testing flow)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "fullName": "Test User"
}

### Login (Dev C)
# @name loginReq
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Extract Tokens
@accessToken = {{loginReq.response.body.data.accessToken}}
# Refresh token is automatically handled via httpOnly cookie by REST clients like IntelliJ/VS Code

### Test Protected Route
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Refresh Token (Dev C)
# @name refreshReq
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh

### Logout (Dev C)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
